a zruty - does a zruty have cloven hooves and chew its cud?  Probably
not, but we can't say for sure.  This looks like a tricky conduct.  It
would probably end up being darn close to vegetarianism if not veganism.

	Halal looks slightly simpler: you may not eat any animal which
